			"Message": "style(Grove): Reformat README with hard-wrapped prose and restored badge header\n\nReinstate the decorative HTML badge table (stars, issues, downloads, last-commit) that was removed in the previous README simplification, keeping it above the title for at-a-glance repo metrics. Hard-wrap all prose paragraphs at ~80 characters for consistent readability across terminals and narrow views. Break each badge link onto its own line instead of chaining them horizontally. Align the component table column headers and separator row. Replace the funding logos table with a refined layout using NLnet's external SVG URLs and explicit cell alignment.\n\nThese formatting changes restore visual polish while preserving the condensed content structure adopted in the recent restructuring.",
